    MOB --> RT
    BFF --> RT
    API --> OBS[Logs JSON · métricas RED · trazas · alertas]
    BFF --> OBS
    MOB --> OBS
    CONTRACT[OpenAPI versionado\nclientes generados + contract tests] --> BFF
    CONTRACT --> MOB
